  "rationale": "Comparison for unit:shared.typing.well_formed_types against lean:Shared/TypingViews:ValueType.WellFormed, lean:Shared/TypingViews:KindValid, lean:Shared/TypingViews:kindAllows. ValueType.WellFormed conjoins nominal view well-formedness with KindValid. kindAllows requires given for classType, either permission for structType and shared for sharedStruct. This matches the prose's shared restriction and lack of a normalized given shared-struct type, independently of exposed view entries. Notation and judgment context was checked in unit:shared.struct, unit:shared.typing.base, unit:shared.typing.nominal_table, unit:given.typing.views.",
